  "details": "So on the day vrchat launched the new profile decorations someone bought me the Electric Pulse decoration 2 out of the 3 works. The only decoration not working is the nameplate decoration and that was the main reason they bought it for me I tried and tried getting it to work and nothing I thought it was a bug at first but I noticed other friends bought it and had no issues just me so I opened up a ticket and they told me to report it here even though this seems like a individual problem. Hopefully you can help cause it is not fair that my friend spent money on something and it is not working.",
